  "solution": "Tọa độ đỉnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>b</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tDo đó đỉnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta xét bảng biến thiên trên đoạn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=